    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sargoni mfalme wa Ashuru, alimtuma jemadari wake mkuu kuuvamia mji wa Ashdodi. Naye akaushambulia na kuuteka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miaka mitatu kabla ya hapo, Mwenyezi-Mungu alikuwa amemwambia Isaya, mwana wa Amozi hivi: “Nenda ukavue vazi la gunia unalovaa kiunoni, na viatu miguuni mwako.” Isaya akafanya hivyo; akawa anatembea uchi na bila viatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, mnamo mwaka huo mji wa Ashdodi ulipotekwa, Mwenyezi-Mungu alisema: “Mtumishi wangu Isaya amekuwa akitembea uchi na bila viatu kwa muda wa miaka mitatu sasa, kama ishara na alama dhidi ya nchi ya Misri na Kushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, mfalme wa Ashuru atawachukua mateka Wamisri na Wakushi, wakubwa kwa wadogo. Watachukuliwa, nao watatembea uchi na bila viatu; matako wazi, kwa aibu ya Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha wote waliotegemea Kushi na kujivunia Misri watajuta na kufadhaika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo, wakazi wa pwani ya Filistia watasema, ‘Tazameni yaliyowapata watu tuliowategemea na kuwakimbilia kuomba msaada watuokoe na mfalme wa Ashuru! Na sasa, sisi tutawezaje kusalimika?’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
